cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you cite this reconstruction, please cite it as below. The argument and
  the formal Lean proof archive that it reconstructs originate with Levent
  Alpöge and Claude (Anthropic); please cite Alpöge's note for the argument
  itself (see "references").
type: software
title: >-
  An End-to-End Reconstruction of the Alpöge–Claude Route to the Riemann
  Hypothesis
abstract: >-
  A reconstruction, in conventional mathematical language, of the Lean proof
  archive released by Levent Alpöge on November 20, 2026. The architecture and
  major mechanisms of the argument are reconstructed end to end. A finite set
  of isolated internal proof packages remains under audit, together with a
  separate literature-verification boundary. On November 21, 2026, the Lean
  and Mathlib communities certified that both the statement and the proof in
  the archive are correct.
